PUBLISHING.md

# esbuild bundles everything into one out/extension.js; nothing else under
# out/ (per-module tsc output from a `tsc -p ./`-era build, leftover on a
# contributor's machine or a not-fully-clean CI checkout, plus the dev
# sourcemap) should ever ship.
out/**
!out/extension.js
